Goodnight, Elle.

1021
00:52:33,942 --> 00:52:34,942
Goodnight, Sam.

1022
00:52:35,027 --> 00:52:35,652
Goodnight.

1023
00:52:35,861 --> 00:52:37,154
Goodnight, Sam.

