1028
00:52:51,168 --> 00:52:54,755
and I saw the love light in their eve.

1029
00:52:54,963 --> 00:52:57,049
That's beautiful, isn't it?

1030
00:53:00,385 --> 00:53:02,304
The life of every man is a diary

